- where Postman was founded. Postman is privately held, with funding from Battery Ventures, BOND, Coatue, CRV, Insight Partners, and Nexus Venture Partners. Learn more at postman.com or connect with Postman on X via @getpostman.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;P.S: We highly recommend reading &lt;a href=&quot;https://api-first-world.com/&quot;&gt;The &quot;API-First World&quot; graphic novel&lt;/a&gt; to understand the bigger picture and our vision at Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive for the IT/ITES vertical, you will be responsible for driving new enterprise revenue across Delhi NCR and North India, one of the country&#39;s largest concentrations of IT services, technology consulting, digital engineering, Saa S, and software product companies.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;You will own the full sales cycle—from prospecting and qualification through contract negotiation and close. You will engage technical stakeholders such as Engineering Leaders, Platform Architects, Enterprise Architects, and Dev Ops teams, while also building relationships with business decision-makers including CTOs, CIOs, CPOs, and Digital Transformation leaders.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is a hunter-first role for someone who thrives on building pipeline, creating opportunities from scratch, and closing complex enterprise software deals. You will play a critical role in helping organizations modernize their API strategy, improve developer productivity, and accelerate their AI transformation journey.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Prospect, qualify, and close new enterprise accounts within an assigned territory or named account list across IT/ITES organizations.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Own the complete sales cycle—from outbound prospecting and discovery to product demonstrations, proof-of-value engagements, commercial negotiations, and contract closure.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a self-generated pipeline of 3–4x quarterly quota through outbound outreach, partner collaboration, industry events, referrals, and inbound opportunities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with technical buyers including VP Engineering, Engineering Directors, Platform Architects, Dev Ops Leaders, and Enterprise Architects.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Engage executive stakeholders including CTOs, CIOs, CPOs, Heads of Engineering, and Digital Transformation leaders.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Partner closely with SDRs and Solutions Engineers to conduct discovery workshops and demonstrate business value aligned to customer priorities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling product demonstrations and executive presentations that highlight how Postman improves developer productivity, API governance, collaboration, testing automation, and AI readiness.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate opportunity management, forecasting, and pipeline hygiene within Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Meet and exceed quarterly and annual new ARR targets.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Customer Success teams to ensure successful onboarding, adoption, and expansion opportunities post-sale.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Represent Postman at industry events, technology conferences, developer communities, and customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Stay informed on market trends and competitive solutions across API management, developer tooling, Dev Ops, cloud, testing, observability, and AI development platforms.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;13–15 years of B2B technology sales experience with a strong track record in enterprise Saa S, developer tools, cloud, infrastructure, or platform software.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Proven history of new logo acquisition and consistent quota attainment at or above target across multiple years.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience selling into IT/ITES organizations such as TCS, Infosys, Wipro, HCLTech, Tech Mahindra, LTIMindtree, Cognizant, Capgemini, Nagarro, Coforge, Birlasoft, Publicis Sapient, Global Logic, and similar enterprises.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise software buying cycles and stakeholder management.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience engaging engineering, platform, infrastructure, cloud, Dev Ops, and product organizations.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong presentation, negotiation, and executive communication skills.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex multi-stakeholder enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce and modern sales engagement platforms.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Self-starter with a hunter mentality and the ability to independently generate and close opportunities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Existing network across IT Services, Digital Engineering, GCCs, Saa S companies, and technology consulting firms in Delhi NCR and North India.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience working at a Product-Led Growth (PLG) company.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Postman or adjacent developer-focused platforms.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience selling developer productivity, Dev Ops, cloud-native, API management, observability, testing, or security solutions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise sales methodologies such as MEDDIC, Challenger Sale, or Command of the Message.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Understanding of API-first architectures, microservices, cloud-native development, and enterprise AI adoption.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt;Pune, India (Hybrid). This role requires regular in-person engagement with accounts across Pune, Mumbai, and occasionally other metros. Estimated travel: 20%&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;In addition to Postman&#39;s pay-on-performance philosophy, and a flexible schedule working with a fun, collaborative team, Postman offers a comprehensive set of benefits, including full medical coverage, flexible PTO, wellness reimbursement, and a monthly lunch stipend. Along with that, our wellness programs will help you stay in the best of your physical and mental health. Our frequent and fascinating team-building events will keep you connected, while our donation-matching program can support the causes you care about. We’re building a long-term company with an inclusive culture where everyone can be the best version of themselves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;At Postman we value in person collaboration. We are in office 5 days a week for all roles based out of our hubs in San Francisco Bay Area, Boston, Austin, New York City, Tokyo and London. For roles based in Bangalore, employees currently work in the office three days a week and will transition to five days per week by the end of the year. We were thoughtful in our approach which is based on collaboration and grounded in feedback from our workforce, leadership team, and peers. The benefits of our in office model will be shared knowledge, brainstorming sessions, communication, and building trust in-person that cannot be replicated via zoom.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3633&quot;&gt;At Postman, we create with the same curiosity that we see in our users. We value transparency and honest communication about not only successes, but also failures. In our work, we focus on specific goals that add up to a larger vision. Our inclusive work culture ensures that everyone is valued equally as important pieces of our final product. We are dedicated to delivering the best products we can.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;Postman is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. Postman does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes. Postman will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Postman is the world’s leading API platform, used by more than 45 million+ developers and 500,000 organizations, including 98% of the Fortune
500. Postman is helping developers and professionals across the globe build the API-first world by simplifying each step of the API lifecycle and streamlining collaboration—enabling users to create better APIs, faster.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The company is headquartered in San Francisco and has offices in Boston, New York, Austin, Tokyo, London, and Bangalore
- where Postman was founded. Postman is privately held, with funding from Battery Ventures, BOND, Coatue, CRV, Insight Partners, and Nexus Venture Partners. Learn more at postman.com or connect with Postman on X via @getpostman.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;P.S: We highly recommend reading &lt;a href=&quot;https://api-first-world.com/&quot;&gt;The &quot;API-First World&quot; graphic novel&lt;/a&gt; to understand the bigger picture and our vision at Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Recruiting Operations Coordinator is the operational backbone of Postman&#39;s recruiting function. In this role, you will ensure that every search runs smoothly from open to close — keeping interviews scheduled, data clean, feedback flowing, and candidates well-informed throughout their experience. This is an ideal role for someone early in their career who is organized, detail-oriented, and excited to build foundational expertise in talent acquisition at a fast-growing technology company. You will work closely with recruiters, hiring managers, and candidates, and will play a direct role in how Postman is perceived as an employer.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Interview Coordination&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end interview scheduling across all active roles, coordinating availability between candidates, interviewers, and hiring managers with a high degree of accuracy and responsiveness&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Send timely confirmations, reminders, and logistical details to all interview participants&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Manage reschedules and last-minute changes with professionalism and minimal disruption to the process&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and solve scheduling or process bottlenecks, continuously improving recruiting workflows and coordination processes&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Data Integrity &amp;amp; ATS Hygiene&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Audit active job requisitions to ensure all required fields are complete and accurate in the ATS — including job details, compensation bands, stage statuses, and interviewer assignments&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Flag and resolve data gaps in collaboration with recruiters before they affect reporting&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Ensure every closed role has a complete and accurate record before it is archived&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feedback &amp;amp; Interview Completion&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Monitor interview completion rates and follow up with interviewers to ensure feedback is submitted within expected SLAs&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Track which interviews have been recorded and flag any gaps to the relevant recruiter&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Maintain a real-time view of where feedback is outstanding across all active searches&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Candidate Experience &amp;amp; Surveys&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Deliver a high-touch, candidate-first experience across every stage of the interview process&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Coordinate the distribution of candidate experience surveys at key touchpoints in the process&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Track response rates and flag low engagement to the recruiting team&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Compile survey results on a regular cadence and summarize key themes for review&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Employer Brand Monitoring&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Monitor Glassdoor, Linked In, Blind, and other relevant platforms for new candidate and employee reviews related to the recruiting and interview experience&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Surface notable feedback to the recruiting team on a regular basis&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Help maintain the accuracy of Postman&#39;s employer profiles across platforms&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Metrics &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Collect and organize data on completed roles, including time to fill, source, offer acceptance, and interview-to-offer ratios&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Prepare regular metric summaries for the Head of Recruiting&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Support the team in ensuring data is ready and accurate for monthly and quarterly reporting cycles&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;You are someone who takes genuine pride in keeping things running well. You notice when something is missing before anyone else does, and you follow through without needing to be reminded. You are comfortable working across multiple workstreams simultaneously and can shift priorities calmly when something urgent comes up.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in any discipline; coursework or internship experience in HR, business, communications, or operations is a plus but not required&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;2-4 years of professional experience; strong internship or project-based experience is equally valued&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail — you catch the things others miss&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong written communication skills; you can write a clear, professional message to a candidate or a senior hiring manager with equal ease&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Comfort with tools like Google Workspace, spreadsheets, and calendar management; experience with an ATS (Greenhouse, Lever, Workday) is a bonus&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;A collaborative, low-ego working style — you understand that your work makes everyone around you more effective&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Curiosity about how recruiting works as a function and interest in growing within talent acquisition or HR operations over time&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth environment while managing multiple priorities with strong ownership and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;In addition to Postman&#39;s pay-on-performance philosophy, and a flexible schedule working with a fun, collaborative team, Postman offers a comprehensive set of benefits, including full medical coverage, flexible PTO, wellness reimbursement, and a monthly lunch stipend. Along with that, our wellness programs will help you stay in the best of your physical and mental health. Our frequent and fascinating team-building events will keep you connected, while our donation-matching program can support the causes you care about. We’re building a long-term company with an inclusive culture where everyone can be the best version of themselves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;At Postman we value in person collaboration. We are in office 5 days a week for all roles based out of our hubs in San Francisco Bay Area, Boston, Austin, New York City, Tokyo and London. For roles based in Bangalore, employees currently work in the office three days a week and will transition to five days per week by the end of the year. We were thoughtful in our approach which is based on collaboration and grounded in feedback from our workforce, leadership team, and peers. The benefits of our in office model will be shared knowledge, brainstorming sessions, communication, and building trust in-person that cannot be replicated via zoom.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3633&quot;&gt;At Postman, we create with the same curiosity that we see in our users. We value transparency and honest communication about not only successes, but also failures. In our work, we focus on specific goals that add up to a larger vision. Our inclusive work culture ensures that everyone is valued equally as important pieces of our final product. We are dedicated to delivering the best products we can.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;Postman is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. Postman does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes. Postman will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Postman is the world’s leading API platform, used by more than 45 million+ developers and 500,000 organizations, including 98% of the Fortune
500. Postman is helping developers and professionals across the globe build the API-first world by simplifying each step of the API lifecycle and streamlining collaboration—enabling users to create better APIs, faster.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The company is headquartered in San Francisco and has offices in Boston, New York, Austin, Tokyo, London, and Bangalore
- where Postman was founded. Postman is privately held, with funding from Battery Ventures, BOND, Coatue, CRV, Insight Partners, and Nexus Venture Partners. Learn more at postman.com or connect with Postman on X via @getpostman.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;P.S: We highly recommend reading &lt;a href=&quot;https://api-first-world.com/&quot;&gt;The &quot;API-First World&quot; graphic novel&lt;/a&gt; to understand the bigger picture and our vision at Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Client Distribution team owns the infrastructure that releases, delivers, and updates every Postman client application—including the Desktop App, Web App, Desktop Agent, and CLI—across all supported operating systems.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Our platform is the critical last mile between a merged pull request and millions of users receiving a reliable update. We build and operate the backend systems, release pipelines, artifact distribution services, rollout mechanisms, and developer tooling that enable hundreds of engineers to ship software safely and efficiently.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Software Engineer who enjoys building scalable backend services, modern deployment platforms, and developer infrastructure while improving the reliability and speed of software delivery.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to work on the platform that powers software delivery across every Postman client application. You&#39;ll solve challenging distributed systems problems, build infrastructure used by engineering teams every day, and directly impact how millions of developers receive updates around the world.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Design, build, and operate backend services responsible for artifact hosting, routing, versioning, and secure client distribution.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Improve CI/CD pipelines to reduce the time from code merge to production rollout through automation and optimized release workflows.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Develop and enhance rollout strategies, staged deployments, feature rollouts, and rollback mechanisms to enable safe software releases.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Build internal tooling and dashboards that improve release visibility, operational efficiency, and developer productivity.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Drive modernization of legacy distribution systems by migrating to scalable, cloud-native services and architectures.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Develop reusable SDKs, deployment actions, and shared tooling that simplify integration across multiple Postman client applications.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Build observability into the release platform through metrics, dashboards, logging, and release analytics to improve system reliability.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Client Platform, Infrastructure, Developer Experience, and Release Engineering teams to improve the software delivery lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Participate in architectural discussions, code reviews, and operational improvements to maintain a high engineering bar.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience building and operating scalable backend services in production.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing REST APIs and distributed backend systems.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Java Script/Type Script or Node.js, with solid software engineering fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational databases such as My SQL or Postgre SQL.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AWS services such as S3, Lambda, Cloud Front, API Gateway, or similar cloud technologies.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of CI/CD systems, preferably Git Hub Actions or equivalent automation platforms.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience building internal developer platforms, deployment tooling, or engineering productivity solutions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CDN architectures, artifact management, or software distribution platforms.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong debugging, troubleshooting, and operational ownership skills.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and a collaborative engineering mindset.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with Node.js and Type Script.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with Mongo DB or other No SQL databases.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Exposure to release engineering, deployment automation, or software delivery platforms.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with Infrastructure as Code using Terraform, AWS CDK, or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Electron application packaging and distribution.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Exposure to Model Context Protocol (MCP) or AI-powered developer tooling.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience building reusable internal libraries or developer tooling.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Release pipelines become faster, more reliable, and highly automated.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Millions of users receive client updates seamlessly with minimal operational overhead.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Internal engineering teams can ship software more confidently through improved tooling and observability.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Distribution systems become simpler, more scalable, and easier to maintain.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Engineering productivity improves through reusable platforms, automation, and a strong focus on developer experience.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;In addition to Postman&#39;s pay-on-performance philosophy, and a flexible schedule working with a fun, collaborative team, Postman offers a comprehensive set of benefits, including full medical coverage, flexible PTO, wellness reimbursement, and a monthly lunch stipend. Along with that, our wellness programs will help you stay in the best of your physical and mental health. Our frequent and fascinating team-building events will keep you connected, while our donation-matching program can support the causes you care about. We’re building a long-term company with an inclusive culture where everyone can be the best version of themselves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;At Postman we value in person collaboration. We are in office 5 days a week for all roles based out of our hubs in San Francisco Bay Area, Boston, Austin, New York City, Tokyo and London. For roles based in Bangalore, employees currently work in the office three days a week and will transition to five days per week by the end of the year. We were thoughtful in our approach which is based on collaboration and grounded in feedback from our workforce, leadership team, and peers. The benefits of our in office model will be shared knowledge, brainstorming sessions, communication, and building trust in-person that cannot be replicated via zoom.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3633&quot;&gt;At Postman, we create with the same curiosity that we see in our users. We value transparency and honest communication about not only successes, but also failures. In our work, we focus on specific goals that add up to a larger vision. Our inclusive work culture ensures that everyone is valued equally as important pieces of our final product. We are dedicated to delivering the best products we can.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;Postman is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. Postman does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes. Postman will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Postman is the world’s leading API platform, used by more than 45 million+ developers and 500,000 organizations, including 98% of the Fortune
500. Postman is helping developers and professionals across the globe build the API-first world by simplifying each step of the API lifecycle and streamlining collaboration—enabling users to create better APIs, faster.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The company is headquartered in San Francisco and has offices in Boston, New York, Austin, Tokyo, London, and Bangalore
- where Postman was founded. Postman is privately held, with funding from Battery Ventures, BOND, Coatue, CRV, Insight Partners, and Nexus Venture Partners. Learn more at postman.com or connect with Postman on X via @getpostman.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;P.S: We highly recommend reading &lt;a href=&quot;https://api-first-world.com/&quot;&gt;The &quot;API-First World&quot; graphic novel&lt;/a&gt; to understand the bigger picture and our vision at Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot; data-local-id=&quot;47145dfcfb00&quot;&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot; data-local-id=&quot;47145dfcfb00&quot;&gt;Postman is now at one of the most consequential inflection points in its history. Enterprises are rapidly shifting from human-driven API workflows to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;multi-agent systems&lt;/strong&gt; — where AI agents autonomously discover, call, and collaborate with APIs, tools, CLIs, and each other. Postman already owns the API design, governance, and lifecycle layer for the enterprise; the next frontier is owning the &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;runtime layer for how agents actually interact with all of it&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;461&quot; data-local-id=&quot;da3b9ea115c0&quot;&gt;Where Postman today is &lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;the API platform for human-first integration&lt;/em&gt;, we are building Postman into &lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;the agent interface fabric for AI-first integration&lt;/em&gt;. That transformation starts with &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fabric Gateway&lt;/strong&gt; — a brand new product, being built from scratch, that will serve as the policy-driven control plane governing how agents connect to APIs, services, and other agents at scale. This is a rare 0-to-1 opportunity inside a company with 40+ million developers already in the ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2 id=&quot;About-the-Team&quot; data-local-id=&quot;49c76374ad0c&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;940&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;956&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b921a6d8f507&quot;&gt;The Fabric Gateway team is building the API gateway for the AI era — one of Postman&#39;s most ambitious greenfield infrastructure products. We&#39;re a small, high-ownership team working 0-to-1, designing and shipping the foundational primitives that will power how agents and applications connect to services securely, at scale.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1280&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9d36e5098786&quot;&gt;This isn&#39;t incremental work. We&#39;re building from scratch — making the kind of decisions that define a product&#39;s architecture for years. If you&#39;ve built platform or infrastructure products at a cloud-native or Saa S company and know what it takes to go from zero to a production system engineers trust, you&#39;ll feel right at home here.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2 id=&quot;What-You&#39;ll-Do&quot; data-local-id=&quot;105414a295ad&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1614&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1632&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f0deef6e4561&quot;&gt;Design, build, and own critical systems of the Fabric Gateway from the ground up — this is founding-level engineering work.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1759&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22ecd4808e26&quot;&gt;Lead architecture decisions for distributed systems that need to be fast, reliable, and correct at scale — handling high request volumes across a diverse ecosystem of services.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1939&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b0b3d1f2cf0d&quot;&gt;Drive technical direction and make high-leverage decisions; you&#39;ll be setting patterns the rest of the team follows.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2059&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aad360232d13&quot;&gt;Own observability, performance, and reliability end-to-end — &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SLA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; targets, monitoring, and on-call are your personal responsibility, not a handoff.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2209&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9bc812ef6865&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with the &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and PM to scope milestones, prioritize ruthlessly, and iterate toward Early Access and GA.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2335&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f69d70f7d365&quot;&gt;Participate in design and code reviews, raise engineering standards, and mentor fellow engineers.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h2 id=&quot;Requirements&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3f63b17ab34e&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2436&quot;&gt;About You&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2452&quot; data-local-id=&quot;906022b144f6&quot;&gt;6+ years of experience building infrastructure-level or platform software in cloud-native or Saa S environments.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2567&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0725df43d1b4&quot;&gt;Proven 0-to-1 track record — you&#39;ve taken something from whiteboard to production and operated it at scale.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2678&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b6b41e8a8b99&quot;&gt;Deep systems design expertise: you&#39;ve built distributed systems that handle high throughput, stay resilient under load, and scale horizontally without breaking operational simplicity.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2865&quot; data-local-id=&quot;740643c2ee87&quot;&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong fundamentals in systems programming and performance-sensitive code are essential.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2976&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1f072bbc822f&quot;&gt;Solid grasp of security primitives: m TLS, JWT, OAuth 2.0, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;RBAC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;/&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;ABAC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3048&quot; data-local-id=&quot;39b4b3f519bd&quot;&gt;High ownership mindset — reliability, performance, and security are your problem, not someone else&#39;s ticket.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3160&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa2ca3b54467&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills; comfortable driving clarity in fast-moving, ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h4 id=&quot;Nice-to-Have&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c205db80318d&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3260&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3276&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ab48d489e611&quot;&gt;Prior experience building or extending platform or gateway products.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3348&quot; data-local-id=&quot;86eb973b8acd&quot;&gt;Familiarity with modern protocol ecosystems (HTTP/2, g RPC, Web Sockets).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3423&quot; data-local-id=&quot;92a93ee91a83&quot;&gt;Kubernetes-native deployment experience: Helm, operators, CRDs.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3490&quot; data-local-id=&quot;90f9af5880d6&quot;&gt;Contributions to open-source infrastructure or developer tooling projects.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3568&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b0090883a3df&quot;&gt;Experience working in an early-stage 0-to-1 environment inside a larger company.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;In addition to Postman&#39;s pay-on-performance philosophy, and a flexible schedule working with a fun, collaborative team, Postman offers a comprehensive set of benefits, including full medical coverage, flexible PTO, wellness reimbursement, and a monthly lunch stipend. Along with that, our wellness programs will help you stay in the best of your physical and mental health. Our frequent and fascinating team-building events will keep you connected, while our donation-matching program can support the causes you care about. We’re building a long-term company with an inclusive culture where everyone can be the best version of themselves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;At Postman we value in person collaboration. We are in office 5 days a week for all roles based out of our hubs in San Francisco Bay Area, Boston, Austin, New York City, Tokyo and London. For roles based in Bangalore, employees currently work in the office three days a week and will transition to five days per week by the end of the year. We were thoughtful in our approach which is based on collaboration and grounded in feedback from our workforce, leadership team, and peers. The benefits of our in office model will be shared knowledge, brainstorming sessions, communication, and building trust in-person that cannot be replicated via zoom.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3633&quot;&gt;At Postman, we create with the same curiosity that we see in our users. We value transparency and honest communication about not only successes, but also failures. In our work, we focus on specific goals that add up to a larger vision. Our inclusive work culture ensures that everyone is valued equally as important pieces of our final product. We are dedicated to delivering the best products we can.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;Postman is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. Postman does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes. Postman will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Postman is the world’s leading API platform, used by more than 45 million+ developers and 500,000 organizations, including 98% of the Fortune
500. Postman is helping developers and professionals across the globe build the API-first world by simplifying each step of the API lifecycle and streamlining collaboration—enabling users to create better APIs, faster.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The company is headquartered in San Francisco and has offices in Boston, New York, Austin, Tokyo, London, and Bangalore
- where Postman was founded. Postman is privately held, with funding from Battery Ventures, BOND, Coatue, CRV, Insight Partners, and Nexus Venture Partners. Learn more at postman.com or connect with Postman on X via @getpostman.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;P.S: We highly recommend reading &lt;a href=&quot;https://api-first-world.com/&quot;&gt;The &quot;API-First World&quot; graphic novel&lt;/a&gt; to understand the bigger picture and our vision at Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Identity and Access Management team is responsible for building a secure, reliable, and seamless identity platform for all Postman users. This team owns the systems behind authentication, session management, access control, service accounts, invites, and other foundational identity capabilities that power the product.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Postman’s identity layer is a critical part of the product experience. It sits on the path of every authenticated request and enables users, teams, and systems to access Postman securely and collaborate effectively. The team works on a mix of core platform improvements, new product capabilities, and reliability/security investments.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Design, build, and evolve backend systems that power Postman’s identity and authentication platform.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Own projects end to end: clarify requirements, drive technical design, implement solutions, manage rollout, and support production.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, Design, and Engineering teams to scope, build, test, and launch new features and platform improvements.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Improve system reliability, scalability, observability, and operational readiness for services owned by the team.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Make sound technical trade-offs between speed, quality, and long-term maintainability in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Lead execution for projects involving 2–3 engineers when needed, including task breakdown, technical guidance, and code reviews.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Participate in debugging, incident response, root cause analysis, and long-term production fixes.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Raise engineering quality by improving test coverage, reviewing designs and code, and advocating for strong software engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Partner with your manager on roadmap, prioritization, and SLAs for the services you own.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Help create a team culture of ownership, reliability, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of experience building complex backend or distributed systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You have experience designing and operating production systems with strong reliability requirements.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You are comfortable owning ambiguous problems and driving them from idea to production with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You have experience leading or guiding small groups of engineers on execution.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You have strong engineering fundamentals in areas like distributed systems, networking, data modeling, and system design.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You write code that is testable, maintainable, and easy to understand.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You are comfortable making architectural and implementation trade-offs, and can explain the reasoning clearly.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You collaborate well with cross-functional stakeholders and are comfortable respectfully challenging PMs, EMs, and peers when needed.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You care about production quality, observability, and operational excellence, not just feature delivery.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;You have good written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Experience We Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with backend technologies such as &lt;strong&gt;Node.js, Java, Python, Go, or Ruby&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;distributed systems&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;cloud infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience building or operating &lt;strong&gt;microservices&lt;/strong&gt; at scale&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;databases, caching, queues, and event-driven systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;testing, monitoring, and incident response&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;authentication, authorization, identity, RBAC, access control, or security-sensitive systems&lt;/strong&gt; is a plus, but not required&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;In addition to Postman&#39;s pay-on-performance philosophy, and a flexible schedule working with a fun, collaborative team, Postman offers a comprehensive set of benefits, including full medical coverage, flexible PTO, wellness reimbursement, and a monthly lunch stipend. Along with that, our wellness programs will help you stay in the best of your physical and mental health. Our frequent and fascinating team-building events will keep you connected, while our donation-matching program can support the causes you care about. We’re building a long-term company with an inclusive culture where everyone can be the best version of themselves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;At Postman we value in person collaboration. We are in office 5 days a week for all roles based out of our hubs in San Francisco Bay Area, Boston, Austin, New York City, Tokyo and London. For roles based in Bangalore, employees currently work in the office three days a week and will transition to five days per week by the end of the year. We were thoughtful in our approach which is based on collaboration and grounded in feedback from our workforce, leadership team, and peers. The benefits of our in office model will be shared knowledge, brainstorming sessions, communication, and building trust in-person that cannot be replicated via zoom.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3633&quot;&gt;At Postman, we create with the same curiosity that we see in our users. We value transparency and honest communication about not only successes, but also failures. In our work, we focus on specific goals that add up to a larger vision. Our inclusive work culture ensures that everyone is valued equally as important pieces of our final product. We are dedicated to delivering the best products we can.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;Postman is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. Postman does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes. Postman will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Postman is the world’s leading API platform, used by more than 45 million+ developers and 500,000 organizations, including 98% of the Fortune
500. Postman is helping developers and professionals across the globe build the API-first world by simplifying each step of the API lifecycle and streamlining collaboration—enabling users to create better APIs, faster.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The company is headquartered in San Francisco and has offices in Boston, New York, Austin, Tokyo, London, and Bangalore
- where Postman was founded. Postman is privately held, with funding from Battery Ventures, BOND, Coatue, CRV, Insight Partners, and Nexus Venture Partners. Learn more at postman.com or connect with Postman on X via @getpostman.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;P.S: We highly recommend reading &lt;a href=&quot;https://api-first-world.com/&quot;&gt;The &quot;API-First World&quot; graphic novel&lt;/a&gt; to understand the bigger picture and our vision at Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Backend Engineer to help us reinvent Postman&#39;s Notifications Platform for the next generation of AI-powered, agent-driven experiences.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;As Postman evolves to support agents and autonomous workflows, notifications become much more than simple alerts. They need to be contextual, intelligent, reliable, and deeply integrated into how users interact with the platform. You&#39;ll play a key role in building the foundation that makes that possible.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a role focused on maintaining an existing system. It&#39;s an opportunity to rethink and rebuild a critical platform from the ground up that will power notification experiences across Postman for years to come.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have significant influence over the platform&#39;s architecture, reliability, and developer experience, working closely with teams across the company to build something scalable, intuitive, and easy to adopt.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;As a Senior Backend Engineer on the Messaging team, you&#39;ll help design and build the next generation of our Notifications Platform.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Some of the things you&#39;ll work on include:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Reimagining the platform to support agentic, event-driven notification workflows.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Designing backend systems that enable contextual notifications triggered by agents, workflows, and product events.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Building reliable platform primitives for triggering, routing, delivery, retries, deduplication, rate limiting, user preferences, and notification lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with teams building Agents and AI-powered experiences to understand their needs and translate them into scalable platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Improving the developer experience through well-designed APIs, self-serve tooling, documentation, and integration workflows.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Expanding observability across the entire notification lifecycle—understanding what triggered a notification, why it was sent, how it was delivered, and whether it succeeded.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Ensuring the platform is designed with reliability and user trust at its core, minimising issues such as duplicate sends, stale notifications, noisy experiences, and incorrect targeting.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Collaborating across infrastructure, product, design, support, and platform teams to deliver a seamless notification experience for both users and internal developers.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Contributing to technical strategy, architecture reviews, engineering standards, and design discussions within the Messaging team.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Mentoring engineers and helping raise the technical bar across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;You&#39;re someone who enjoys building platforms that other engineers love to use and can confidently navigate complex distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We&#39;re excited to talk if you have:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;6+ years of backend engineering experience building distributed systems, platform services, or large-scale backend applications.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in one or more common backend languages such as Java Script, Python, Java, Go, PHP, or C++.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience designing APIs, frameworks, or platform abstractions that are used by multiple engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of reliability, observability, operational excellence, and system failure modes.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience working with event-driven architectures, messaging systems, queues, workflow engines, or orchestration platforms.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;The ability to translate product requirements into durable, scalable platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and experience driving alignment across teams with different priorities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;A preference for simple, reliable solutions over unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a sense of ownership that helps move ambiguous projects from idea to production.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Curiosity about AI and agentic product experiences, and how infrastructure needs to evolve to support them.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;And, ideally, a good sense of humour, we appreciate people who enjoy what they do.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;In addition to Postman&#39;s pay-on-performance philosophy, and a flexible schedule working with a fun, collaborative team, Postman offers a comprehensive set of benefits, including full medical coverage, flexible PTO, wellness reimbursement, and a monthly lunch stipend. Along with that, our wellness programs will help you stay in the best of your physical and mental health. Our frequent and fascinating team-building events will keep you connected, while our donation-matching program can support the causes you care about. We’re building a long-term company with an inclusive culture where everyone can be the best version of themselves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;At Postman we value in person collaboration. We are in office 5 days a week for all roles based out of our hubs in San Francisco Bay Area, Boston, Austin, New York City, Tokyo and London. For roles based in Bangalore, employees currently work in the office three days a week and will transition to five days per week by the end of the year. We were thoughtful in our approach which is based on collaboration and grounded in feedback from our workforce, leadership team, and peers. The benefits of our in office model will be shared knowledge, brainstorming sessions, communication, and building trust in-person that cannot be replicated via zoom.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3633&quot;&gt;At Postman, we create with the same curiosity that we see in our users. We value transparency and honest communication about not only successes, but also failures. In our work, we focus on specific goals that add up to a larger vision. Our inclusive work culture ensures that everyone is valued equally as important pieces of our final product. We are dedicated to delivering the best products we can.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;Postman is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. Postman does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes. Postman will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Postman is the world’s leading API platform, used by more than 45 million+ developers and 500,000 organizations, including 98% of the Fortune
500. Postman is helping developers and professionals across the globe build the API-first world by simplifying each step of the API lifecycle and streamlining collaboration—enabling users to create better APIs, faster.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The company is headquartered in San Francisco and has offices in Boston, New York, Austin, Tokyo, London, and Bangalore
- where Postman was founded. Postman is privately held, with funding from Battery Ventures, BOND, Coatue, CRV, Insight Partners, and Nexus Venture Partners. Learn more at postman.com or connect with Postman on X via @getpostman.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;P.S: We highly recommend reading &lt;a href=&quot;https://api-first-world.com/&quot;&gt;The &quot;API-First World&quot; graphic novel&lt;/a&gt; to understand the bigger picture and our vision at Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Staff Engineer to join our Observability team. This role is ideal for a highly technical engineer who thrives on uncovering the truth behind complex system behaviors, diagnosing difficult production challenges, and driving platform-wide improvements.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer, you will operate as a force multiplier across engineering teams, helping Postman build world-class observability capabilities while improving reliability, performance, and developer productivity. You will partner closely with Infrastructure, Platform, Product, Security, and Data teams to identify systemic issues, establish operational excellence, and ensure engineering teams have the visibility they need to operate at scale.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Drive the technical vision and architecture for Postman&#39;s observability platform.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Design and build scalable solutions for metrics, logging, tracing, alerting, and operational analytics.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Investigate complex production issues, identify root causes, and drive long-term corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering teams to improve service reliability, availability, performance, and operational maturity.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Establish observability standards, best practices, and instrumentation frameworks across the company.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Build tooling and automation that enable faster incident detection, diagnosis, and resolution.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Leverage telemetry data to uncover performance bottlenecks, capacity risks, and reliability gaps.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Drive cross-functional initiatives focused on platform health, operational excellence, and engineering productivity.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Mentor senior engineers and help raise the technical bar across the organization.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience with significant exposure to distributed systems and cloud-native architectures.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in observability domains including monitoring, logging, distributed tracing, telemetry pipelines, and incident management.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience operating large-scale production systems with a strong focus on reliability, scalability, and performance.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of system debugging, root-cause analysis, performance optimization, and production operations.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong programming experience in one or more languages such as Go, Java, Python, Node.js, or similar.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with observability technologies such as Open Telemetry, Prometheus, Grafana, Elasticsearch, Datadog, New Relic, Splunk, Honeycomb, or equivalent platforms.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Ability to influence technical direction across teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a data-driven approach to problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience building internal developer platforms or observability platforms at scale.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Exposure to AIOps, intelligent alerting, anomaly detection, or AI-powered operational tooling.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience driving reliability initiatives across multiple engineering organizations.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Background in SRE, Platform Engineering, Infrastructure Engineering, or Developer Productivity.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Observability team sits at the center of Postman&#39;s engineering ecosystem. Success in this role means creating the visibility, insights, and operational intelligence that enable every engineering team at Postman to build and operate reliable products with confidence.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact Staff Engineer position for someone who enjoys solving complex distributed systems challenges, driving engineering excellence, and uncovering the signals that help teams make better decisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;In addition to Postman&#39;s pay-on-performance philosophy, and a flexible schedule working with a fun, collaborative team, Postman offers a comprehensive set of benefits, including full medical coverage, flexible PTO, wellness reimbursement, and a monthly lunch stipend. Along with that, our wellness programs will help you stay in the best of your physical and mental health. Our frequent and fascinating team-building events will keep you connected, while our donation-matching program can support the causes you care about. We’re building a long-term company with an inclusive culture where everyone can be the best version of themselves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;At Postman we value in person collaboration. We are in office 5 days a week for all roles based out of our hubs in San Francisco Bay Area, Boston, Austin, New York City, Tokyo and London. For roles based in Bangalore, employees currently work in the office three days a week and will transition to five days per week by the end of the year. We were thoughtful in our approach which is based on collaboration and grounded in feedback from our workforce, leadership team, and peers. The benefits of our in office model will be shared knowledge, brainstorming sessions, communication, and building trust in-person that cannot be replicated via zoom.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3633&quot;&gt;At Postman, we create with the same curiosity that we see in our users. We value transparency and honest communication about not only successes, but also failures. In our work, we focus on specific goals that add up to a larger vision. Our inclusive work culture ensures that everyone is valued equally as important pieces of our final product. We are dedicated to delivering the best products we can.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;Postman is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. Postman does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes. Postman will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Postman is the world’s leading API platform, used by more than 45 million+ developers and 500,000 organizations, including 98% of the Fortune
500. Postman is helping developers and professionals across the globe build the API-first world by simplifying each step of the API lifecycle and streamlining collaboration—enabling users to create better APIs, faster.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The company is headquartered in San Francisco and has offices in Boston, New York, Austin, Tokyo, London, and Bangalore
- where Postman was founded. Postman is privately held, with funding from Battery Ventures, BOND, Coatue, CRV, Insight Partners, and Nexus Venture Partners. Learn more at postman.com or connect with Postman on X via @getpostman.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;P.S: We highly recommend reading &lt;a href=&quot;https://api-first-world.com/&quot;&gt;The &quot;API-First World&quot; graphic novel&lt;/a&gt; to understand the bigger picture and our vision at Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;As a Strategic Account Director for the BFSI vertical, you will own Postman&#39;s most important accounts — India&#39;s largest banks, NBFCs, insurers, and AMCs. This is a high-visibility, senior individual contributor role that sits at the intersection of enterprise sales, executive relationship management, and industry evangelism. You will be the trusted advisor to C-suite and senior platform engineering leaders across BFSI, helping them understand how an API-first strategy — underpinned by Postman — accelerates digital transformation, reduces time-to-market, and builds competitive advantage. You will own the full revenue lifecycle — new logos, multi-year expansions, and renewals — while building long-term strategic partnerships that compound over time. You will also identify and engage key ISVs within the BFSI ecosystem, driving co-sell and joint-influence motions that amplify Postman&#39;s reach in the sector.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Own and grow a portfolio of named strategic BFSI accounts (private and PSU banks, NBFCs, insurance majors, AMCs, capital markets firms) — responsible for new sales, expansion, upsell, cross-sell, and renewals to deliver multi-year ARR targets&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Develop and execute multi-year strategic account plans that map Postman&#39;s platform capabilities to each account&#39;s digital transformation priorities (API modernisation, cloud migration, AI adoption, digital banking)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Build and maintain trusted C-suite and senior executive relationships (CTO, CIO, CISO, CDO, VP Engineering, Head of Digital) — positioning Postman as a strategic platform partner, not a point tool&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Identify, engage, and build relationships with key BFSI-focused ISVs and system integrators to develop joint go-to-market and co-sell strategies that accelerate customer adoption&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Lead complex, multi-stakeholder deal cycles from initial discovery through commercial close, including procurement, legal, information security, and regulatory compliance reviews&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Partner with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, and Professional Services to design and deliver compelling proof-of-value engagements that demonstrate measurable ROI&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver Executive Business Reviews (EBRs/QBRs) that connect Postman platform usage to business outcomes relevant to BFSI leaders&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Map account white-space and maintain a 3x pipeline coverage ratio through structured account planning, stakeholder expansion, and executive sponsorship programmes&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Represent Postman at BFSI industry forums, RBI/SEBI technology roundtables, customer advisory boards, and executive briefings to build brand and market presence&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Marketing, and Partnerships on BFSI-specific use cases, competitive intelligence, customer advisory inputs, and go-to-market assets&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Accurately forecast committed revenue using MEDDPICC methodology and maintain rigorous CRM hygiene in Salesforce&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to navigate long, regulated procurement cycles common in the BFSI sector, including RFP/RFI response coordination&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;18+ years of total B2B enterprise technology sales experience, with at least 7+ years of dedicated focus on BFSI accounts in India&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Consistent, documented track record of exceeding quota on deals of ₹4–15 Cr+ ACV in enterprise Saa S, cloud, or developer/Dev Ops tooling&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of the Indian BFSI landscape — key institutions (private banks, PSU banks, insurance majors, NBFCs, capital markets), their buying patterns, regulatory environment, and digital transformation priorities&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead complex, multi-threaded enterprise deals involving procurement, legal, infosec, and C-suite sign-off in regulated environments&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Executive presence and credibility — proven ability to engage, influence, and build trust with Cx O and Board-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience selling technology into regulated environments with long sales cycles (9–18 months)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Self-starter with the ability to work in ambiguity, take ownership of outcomes, and drive results with cross-functional team collaboration&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Prior experience at a developer tooling, Dev Ops, API, or cloud-native company (e.g., Mule Soft/Apigee, Salesforce, Service Now, Git Lab, Kong, Hashicorp)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Understanding of API-first architectures, microservices, Dev Sec Ops, and AI/ML adoption in enterprise banking and insurance contexts&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise sales methodologies such as MEDDIC, MEDDPICC, or SPIN&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Existing C-level network within major Indian BFSI institutions&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;MBA from a reputed institution or equivalent advanced qualification&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Mumbai, India (Hybrid). This role requires regular in-person engagement with BFSI customers across Mumbai and key financial centers (Pune, Bengaluru, Chennai, Delhi NCR). Estimated travel: 20-30%.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;In addition to Postman&#39;s pay-on-performance philosophy, and a flexible schedule working with a fun, collaborative team, Postman offers a comprehensive set of benefits, including full medical coverage, flexible PTO, wellness reimbursement, and a monthly lunch stipend. Along with that, our wellness programs will help you stay in the best of your physical and mental health. Our frequent and fascinating team-building events will keep you connected, while our donation-matching program can support the causes you care about. We’re building a long-term company with an inclusive culture where everyone can be the best version of themselves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;At Postman we value in person collaboration. We are in office 5 days a week for all roles based out of our hubs in San Francisco Bay Area, Boston, Austin, New York City, Tokyo and London. For roles based in Bangalore, employees currently work in the office three days a week and will transition to five days per week by the end of the year. We were thoughtful in our approach which is based on collaboration and grounded in feedback from our workforce, leadership team, and peers. The benefits of our in office model will be shared knowledge, brainstorming sessions, communication, and building trust in-person that cannot be replicated via zoom.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3633&quot;&gt;At Postman, we create with the same curiosity that we see in our users. We value transparency and honest communication about not only successes, but also failures. In our work, we focus on specific goals that add up to a larger vision. Our inclusive work culture ensures that everyone is valued equally as important pieces of our final product. We are dedicated to delivering the best products we can.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;Postman is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. Postman does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes. Postman will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Postman is the world’s leading API platform, used by more than 45 million+ developers and 500,000 organizations, including 98% of the Fortune
500. Postman is helping developers and professionals across the globe build the API-first world by simplifying each step of the API lifecycle and streamlining collaboration—enabling users to create better APIs, faster.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The company is headquartered in San Francisco and has offices in Boston, New York, Austin, Tokyo, London, and Bangalore
- where Postman was founded. Postman is privately held, with funding from Battery Ventures, BOND, Coatue, CRV, Insight Partners, and Nexus Venture Partners. Learn more at postman.com or connect with Postman on X via @getpostman.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;P.S: We highly recommend reading &lt;a href=&quot;https://api-first-world.com/&quot;&gt;The &quot;API-First World&quot; graphic novel&lt;/a&gt; to understand the bigger picture and our vision at Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Talent Researcher&lt;/strong&gt; to join our TA team. In this role, you will be responsible for driving the top-of-funnel sourcing efforts to build a strong talent pipeline for technical and business functions. You will partner with recruiters, hiring managers, and business leaders to create and execute targeted sourcing strategies that attract diverse, high-caliber talent across key roles.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Lead proactive sourcing efforts for key technical and business roles, including Software Engineers, Product roles, and other critical functions across different teams.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring teams to understand role requirements and team culture, ensuring sourcing strategies align with business needs.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Map talent across our target companies in specific geographies and come up with clever ways to engage them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Utilize a variety of sourcing channels (Linked In Recruiter, Git Hub, Stack Overflow, Boolean search, events, networking) to engage and attract passive candidates.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain a strong pipeline of talent, focusing on both current and future hiring needs.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Conduct initial candidate outreach, screening, and assessment to ensure alignment with role requirements and team dynamics.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with recruiters to manage candidate flow and ensure timely movement through the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Maintain an organized and efficient ATS (Greenhouse), ensuring all candidate data is up to date and tracked accurately.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Analyze data and market trends to refine sourcing strategies and improve the quality of candidates being sourced.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Provide a seamless, high-touch candidate experience from initial contact through the early stages of the recruitment process.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;7+ years of sourcing experience, with a proven track record of identifying and engaging top talent in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong experience sourcing for technical roles (e.g., Software Engineers, Applied Engineers, Product Designers) and other business functions (e.g., Marketing, Sales, Operations).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Expertise in using advanced sourcing tools and platforms (Linked In Recruiter, Git Hub, X-ray search, Boolean search, Gem, etc.).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Highly proficient in using AI and Agents to research, map and identify hard to find talent&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of the tech talent landscape, market trends, and competitor hiring strategies.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills with the ability to influence hiring managers and recruiters based on market insights and candidate availability.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Highly organized with the ability to manage multiple projects and deadlines simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Data-driven approach to sourcing, with experience using metrics to optimize processes and improve results.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication skills with a focus on delivering a world-class candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;In addition to Postman&#39;s pay-on-performance philosophy, and a flexible schedule working with a fun, collaborative team, Postman offers a comprehensive set of benefits, including full medical coverage, flexible PTO, wellness reimbursement, and a monthly lunch stipend. Along with that, our wellness programs will help you stay in the best of your physical and mental health. Our frequent and fascinating team-building events will keep you connected, while our donation-matching program can support the causes you care about. We’re building a long-term company with an inclusive culture where everyone can be the best version of themselves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;At Postman we value in person collaboration. We are in office 5 days a week for all roles based out of our hubs in San Francisco Bay Area, Boston, Austin, New York City, Tokyo and London. For roles based in Bangalore, employees currently work in the office three days a week and will transition to five days per week by the end of the year. We were thoughtful in our approach which is based on collaboration and grounded in feedback from our workforce, leadership team, and peers. The benefits of our in office model will be shared knowledge, brainstorming sessions, communication, and building trust in-person that cannot be replicated via zoom.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3633&quot;&gt;At Postman, we create with the same curiosity that we see in our users. We value transparency and honest communication about not only successes, but also failures. In our work, we focus on specific goals that add up to a larger vision. Our inclusive work culture ensures that everyone is valued equally as important pieces of our final product. We are dedicated to delivering the best products we can.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;Postman is an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. Postman does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes. Postman will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with Postman.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
